<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>Bitlocker - Key Protectors - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This analysis provides the key protectors protecting each bitlocker encrypted volume.</P>
<P>This analysis relies on the information provided by the <STRONG>Fixlet: Invoke - Bitlocker Configuration Probe - Windows</STRONG></P>
<P>Information on using this content is available here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect/wiki/Bitlocker">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect/wiki/Bitlocker</A></P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Protect content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Protect</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists files whose (name of it contains &quot;Status&quot;) of folder &quot;Bitlocker&quot; of folder &quot;__Global&quot; of data folder of client</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="1" Name="Bitlocker - TPM Protected - Windows" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">(preceding text of first &quot;-&quot; of name of it , concatenation &quot;&quot; of substrings separated by &quot;%00&quot; of (lines of it as string) contains &quot;TPM&quot;) of files whose (Name of it contains &quot;Status&quot;) of folder &quot;BitLocker&quot; of folder &quot;__Global&quot; of data folder of client</Property>
    <Property ID="2" Name="Bitlocker - Recovery Password Enabled - Windows" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">(preceding text of first &quot;-&quot; of name of it , concatenation &quot;&quot; of substrings separated by &quot;%00&quot; of (lines of it as string) contains &quot;Numerical Password&quot;) of files whose (Name of it contains &quot;Status&quot;) of folder &quot;BitLocker&quot; of folder &quot;__Global&quot; of data folder of client</Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
